<h1 id="support">Support</h1>

<p>When something doesn’t work as expected then please first see the
<a href="https://docs.magit.vc">FAQ</a>.  Then also try the list of <a href="https://github.com/magit/magit/issues">open issues</a> and use
the search box at the top of that page to find older related issues.
You should also consult the [manual][manual] and ask a general-purpose
search engine.</p>

<p>If that doesn’t answer your question, then ask for help on the
<a href="https://emacs.stackexchange.com/questions/tagged/magit">Emacs Stackexchange site</a>, the <a href="https://www.reddit.com/r/emacs">Emacs Subreddit</a>
or <a href="https://github.com/magit/magit/discussions/4630">Github discussions</a>.</p>

<p>Please do NOT use the GitHub issue tracker for support requests.
We only use it for feature requests and bug reports.</p>

